  {
    "hotel_id": "31637914",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/the-people-paris-marais/hotel/paris-fr.html",
    "name": "The People Paris Marais",
    "detail": "First of all, the location is really good as it is at the edge of the Marais district, close to Bastille. The Line 7 subway station is extremely close, and Lines 1, 5, 8, etc. are all within about a 10-minute walk. You can easily reach major tourist attractions like the Louvre, Champs-Élysées, and Arc de Triomphe without transfers. Additionally, right in front of the accommodation is along the Seine River, so you can freely enjoy walks or running along the river. The facilities of the accommodation were very clean, possibly newly built, and besides personal drawers, there were quite handy storage compartments under the beds. The shared kitchen was also very clean and well-equipped, making it easy to cook. However, the refrigerator was a bit full. Although the price is a bit high for a hostel, considering the lodging prices in Paris, it seems to be a satisfactory aspect. I stayed for nearly 20 days and overall, I was very satisfied and would likely use it again next time!",
