  {
    "hotel_id": "31638077",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/les-piaules-nation/hotel/paris-fr.html",
    "name": "The People Paris Nation",
    "detail": "I stayed for three nights. In terms of access, it is located just above the nation station. Since nation is a so-called terminal station, it is very convenient for access to major stations. The staff at the reception were very handsome and kind, and I was very satisfied. The bedroom was quiet and very clean. The bed itself was a bit wider, with curtains provided, and although it was a bunk bed, it had some height, making it quite comfortable compared to other youth hostels. Above all, having air conditioning was the best. Regarding the shared spaces, the showers and toilets were somewhat small, but they were well maintained, and there is a door for each shower, which is reassuring. Also, there is one hairdryer available in the shared space. The rooftop serves as the breakfast area and bar space. When you go out to the rooftop at night, you can see the illuminated Eiffel Tower in the distance. Overall, I thought it was a wonderful youth hostel.",
